  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\">若您想將此模組加入您的模組包，歡迎自由使用 :)</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">本模組新增名為「顯示器」的方塊，可讓您直接展示來自Imgur的圖片（僅允許Imgur以防止顯示色情內容）。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">預設最大允許尺寸為8x8。要顯示圖片，只需對該方塊右鍵並貼上圖片網址（例如「<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fi.imgur.com%252fW7lJrbu.jpeg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://i.imgur.com/W7lJrbu.jpeg</a>」或「W7lJrbu」）。<br></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">僅允許png、jpg、jpeg或gif格式檔案。</span></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1052/323/2024-12-29_17.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"601\" height=\"338\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1052/324/2024-12-29_17.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"601\" height=\"338\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/GFKte9h.mp4\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/GFKte9h.mp4\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/a/rL4DBmR\" alt=\"\"></strong><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/wiwHhmV.gif\" width=\"601\" height=\"338\"></span><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>顯示器介面：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1052/325/2024-12-29_17.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"601\" height=\"338\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>拉伸</strong>：將圖片縮放至填滿整個空間。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>限制編輯</strong>：限制介面存取權限，僅允許擁有者進行修改。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>顯示碰撞箱</strong>：切換邊界框的可見性，當準星對準方塊時會顯示。</span><br><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>合成配方：</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1052/327/recipe.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"496\" height=\"248\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p>",
